{"id":"n16014-1-4","stage":2,"title":"앉히다 · 使坐下","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16014-1-4-1","ko":"승규야, 지수를 자리에 앉히고 마실 거 좀 줘라.","zh":"承奎，让智秀坐下，然后给她拿点喝的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"지수를","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지수를","audio":"/audio/e9f75725b9488ce72144.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"자리에","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉히고","meaning":"使坐下","explanation":"앉히다：使坐下；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"앉히다","audio":"/audio/373be7f368d8be4b3bac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16014","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마실","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줘라.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"373be7f368d8be4b","term":"앉히다","zh":"使坐下","audio":"/audio/373be7f368d8be4b3bac.mp3","entryId":"16014","definition":"让某人坐。","pronunciation":["안치다"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e5c2c570475c533030f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16014-1-4-2","ko":"네. 지수야, 여기 앉아.","zh":"好的。智秀，你坐这儿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉아.","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]}],"audio":"/audio/42e80afb41b088dcfd90.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.318,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16014","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":78,"sequenceScore":2.1447,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["承奎，让智秀坐下，然后给她拿点喝的吧。","好的。智秀，你坐这儿吧。","请告诉我这种药的服用方法。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎，让智秀坐下，然后给她拿点喝的吧。","好的。智秀，你坐这儿吧。","请告诉我这种药的服用方法。"],"answer":1}]}
